  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Knotted roots and blackened leaves twist into the shape of an enormous wolf. Violet light pulses beneath its bark in time with the crystals of its den. Once a living guardian of this cavern, it has been corrupted by the dark side, feeding on the fear and pain of those drawn to the Shattervein. Every breath carries the scent of scorched sap; every howl tears at the thoughts of intruders."
